# Step 3: Decisions («Решения»)
Row: Вопрос | Варианты | Выбрано | Почему | Дата (`2026-10-21`). Append only; a changed decision is a new row referencing the old.
- Disagreeing side writes options (Выбрано empty) and hands back.
- No agreement: lead decides by the rules; else ONE owner question with options + recommendation (issue comment, status На ревью).
- Owner answer: recorded impersonally in the row and on the issue («**Итог:** решено: ...»), status back to В работе.
- Executor without wiki/owner access: return the options table; never decide approval items.
